====Usage notes====
The [[oblique case]]s of singular '''''дитя''''', except for the [[accusative case]], are never used in speech or modern prose writing. Instead, the corresponding cases of {{m|ru|ребёнок}} are used, the plural form {{m|ru|де́ти}} is standard and in common use.

